---
/** Older homes near downtown and newer family homes: Tomball's local angle. */
import type { SiteConfig } from "@carpet/seo"
import SitePhoto from "@carpet/ui/SitePhoto.astro"
import type { PhotoSlot } from "@carpet/ui/photo"

interface Props {
  site: SiteConfig
  photo?: PhotoSlot
}
const { site, photo } = Astro.props
---

<section class="section on" aria-labelledby="on-h">
  <div class="wrap on__in">
    <div>
      <h2 id="on-h">Old Tomball and new Tomball</h2>
      <p>Near Main Street, a lot of homes have wood floors, a family rug or two and bedroom carpet that's been down a long time. Those get a fiber and dye check, and a lighter hand on worn seams.</p>
      <p>Out in the newer subdivisions, most carpet is upstairs, and the stairs and landings wear first. Those get extra pre-treatment and a step-by-step cleaning.</p>
      <p><a href="/services/area-rug-cleaning">About rug cleaning</a> · <a href="/areas/northpointe">Northpointe homes</a></p>
    </div>
    <SitePhoto site={site} photo={photo} sizes="(min-width: 52rem) 24rem, 100vw" />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .on__in { display: grid; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
  .on a { display: inline-block; padding: .3rem 0; font-weight: 650; }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) { .on__in { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; } }
</style>
